# English-Only Content

**All published content must be in English.**

Applies to:
- Captions, hooks, scripts, carousel slide text
- On-image text overlays and cover headlines
- Story copy, polls, quiz questions, CTAs
- Hashtag strategy (English keywords)
- Higgsfield `generate_image` prompts: request English-only UI placeholders; never render Korean text in images
- Trend reports and daily content packages in `content/` and `reports/`

Read `config/account-profile.json` → `content_language: "en"`.

Never use @snsai — official handle is @art_of_vector27 only.

Agent/chat responses to the user may be in Korean if the user writes in Korean — but **deliverable post content is always English.**
